<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
C1640: RBS Control Temporary Inhibition
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
RBS control module detects this DTC if any one of the following conditions is met.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Poor visibility of millimeter wave radar.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
High temperature in RBS control module.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Power supply for RBS control module is not between 10.0 and 15.5 V for 2 seconds continuously.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS control module received temporary stop signal from ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> control module.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS control module received invalid outside air temperature sensor signal from BCM.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Millimeter wave radar surface
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS control module power supply / ground circuit
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Charging system
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Outside air temperature sensor
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS control module
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
