<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124020006">
<title>
Clearance of diagnostic information
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that no DTC is indicated.
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Perform troubleshooting for applicable DTC if any DTC is detected.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clear DTC(s) using SUZUKI scan tool.
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Perform “DTC clear” although DTC is not detected.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Select “Data List” mode and check that each of the following parameters is “OK”.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Radar Visibility
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS Control Module Temperature Condition
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
RBS Control Module Voltage Condition
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ABS/ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> Control Module Condition
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Outside Air Temperature Condition
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “OFF” and disconnect SUZUKI scan tool from DLC.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124020007">
<title>
Diagnosis flow: [a]
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Even if millimeter wave radar surface is not soiled, RBS control module may detect poor visibility on millimeter wave radar and output DTC C1640 because diffused reflection is caused due to road conditions such as inside of tunnel, a road with concrete walls on both sides or weather conditions such as heavy rain or snow. If the vehicle is driven for about 2 minutes after the above conditions have improved, RBS control module clears the DTC and resumes the system function automatically.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLSB0AA124020008">
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0AA124020009">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<question>
Is current DTC C1640 detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 and check that parameter “Radar Visibility” on SUZUKI scan tool is “OK”.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0AA124020010">
<title>
Visual inspection for soil on millimeter wave radar surface
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check millimeter wave radar surface for soil or damage.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 after switching ignition from “OFF” to “ON” and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA124004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Clean or replace millimeter wave radar device and perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 after switching ignition from “OFF” to “ON”, and then check that parameter “Radar Visibility” on SUZUKI scan tool is “OK”.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124020011">
<title>
Diagnosis flow: [b]
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLSB0AA124020012">
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0AA124020013">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<question>
Is current DTC C1640 detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 and check that parameter “RBS Control Module Temperature Condition” on SUZUKI scan tool is “OK”.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0AA124020014">
<title>
DTC recheck
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “OFF” and leave the vehicle for a while avoiding direct sunshine.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA124004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is current DTC C1640 detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AA124004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA124020006">Clearance of diagnostic information</intxref>
 and check that parameter “RBS Control Module Temperature Condition” on SUZUKI scan tool is “OK”.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0AA124020015">
<title>
Diagnosis flow: [c]
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLSB0AA124020016">
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0AA124020017">
<title>
DTC check
</title>
<question>
Is current DTC C1640 detected?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
